Common Suite Teardown
    [Documentation]  Cleans up testing environment after running test suite.
    ...              IMPORTANT! Whenever "gNB" is mentioned here it also includes tested BTS with only LTE RAT configured on it (LTE only).
    ...
    ...              ARGS:
    ...              - make_report (bool): defines whether report from test suite execution should be send to Reporting Portal;
    ...                                    if set to False but report from manual test suite execution should be available in Reporting Portal then
    ...                                    report must be send manually;
    ...                                    defaults to: False (report will not be send);
    ...                                    recommended value: True mostly for KPI testing, False otherwise
    ...              - lock_rmods_after_execution (bool): defines whether all RMODs should be locked after test suite execution;
    ...                                                   defaults to: False (RMODs will not be locked);
    ...                                                   recommended value: False
    [Arguments]      ${make_report}=${False}
    ...              ${lock_rmods_after_execution}=${False}
    ...              ${rollback_if_knife_sw}=${True}
    ...              ${check_if_enb_gnss_update_is_ongoing}=${True}
    Robot Log Operation                         Suite Teardown is being performed.
    ${bts_type}=                                hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${bts_setup}=                               hwpta_testline.get_bts_setup_mode
    ${is_simulated}=                            hwpta_testline.is_simulated

    IF                                          ${rollback_if_knife_sw}
        Run Keyword And Ignore Error            Rollback SW If Knife Build On Active Partition And Wait for OnAir State
        ...                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    END

    Run Keyword If                              ${check_if_enb_gnss_update_is_ongoing} and """${bts_setup}"""=='NSA'
    ...                                         Run Keyword And Ignore Error
    ...                                         Run Keywords
    ...                                         Start Alarms Watchdog
    ...                                         AND
    ...                                         Create admin client session to LTE via VM
    ...                                         AND
    ...                                         Handle GPS Firmware Update
    ...                                         bts_type=ENB
    ...                                         use_proxy=${True}
    ...                                         AND
    ...                                         Alarms.Stop Watching Alarms
    ...                                         bts_type=ENB
    Run Keyword If                              ${lock_rmods_after_execution}
    ...                                         Lock RMODs
    ...                                         bts_type=${bts_type}
    Alarms.Stop Watching Alarms
    Run Keyword If                              ${is_simulated}
    ...                                         simulator.teardown
    Close connections
    Robot Log Result                            Alarms watchdog has stopped, connections have been closed.
    [Teardown]  run keyword and ignore error    send_report_to_reporting_portal   kpi_tc=${make_report}
    ...                                                                           bts_type=${bts_type}

